<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 104,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 104,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 104,000 head at interior Iowa Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $0.50 lower compared with mid-session Tuesday. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   County		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    56.00 -57.00	   57.00 -58.00</p>
<p>few				 57.50		    58.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -51.00	   47.00 -52.00</p>
